# Two sites on the apex

This repo is a freelance **portfolio** (`/`) and a personal **blog** (`/blog`, `/rss`). They share a domain and an Astro deploy only.

- `src/pages` is routes. Pages import from one tree: `src/portfolio/` or `src/blog/`.
- Do not share layouts, components, CSS, design tokens, or fonts. Duplicate Head, footer, and analytics.
- Cross-links are exits (Writing → `/blog`, later Work → `/`), not shared chrome.

Full strategy: [docs/two-sites-on-apex.md](docs/two-sites-on-apex.md).
